Upgrade node-fetch from 2.6.0 to 2.6.7

node-fetch before 2.6.7 forwards the Authorization and Cookie headers when a
redirect leaves the original origin (GHSA-r683-j2x4-v87g, CVE-2022-0235), and
before 2.6.1 the size option is not honoured after a redirect (CVE-2020-15168).
The upstream probe follows redirects, so a redirecting peer could read our
credentials. 2.6.7 fixes both; the lockfile gains its whatwg-url dependency.
